GitLab Flavored Markdown
========================

This file tests GitLab Flavored Markdown (GFM) rendering in OctoLab.

## Text Formatting

**Bold text** and _italic text_ and ~~strikethrough~~.

Inline `code` and a [link](https://gitlab.com).

## Lists

Unordered:

- Item one
- Item two
- Item three

Ordered:

1. First item
2. Second item
3. Third item

## Task Lists (GFM)

- [x] Completed task
- [ ] Pending task
- [x] Another done item

## Blockquote

> GitLab is a complete DevOps platform.
> Delivered as a single application.

